{
    "word": "oldness",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "97eed2bd-bd69-362f-904d-67cf73ed1068",
                "word": "oldness",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d1b7825f-7fbe-4a90-b946-4fc414323d1f",
                        "entry_id": "97eed2bd-bd69-362f-904d-67cf73ed1068",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "oldnesses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8470c20b-1a7e-36ed-beac-6962f4fa9965",
                        "entry_id": "97eed2bd-bd69-362f-904d-67cf73ed1068",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state of being old; age."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdcc8d08-bd14-4261-8656-c117ec9d0557",
                                "sense_id": "8470c20b-1a7e-36ed-beac-6962f4fa9965",
                                "text": "This policy and reverence of age makes the world bitter to the best of our times; keeps our fortunes from us till our oldness cannot relish them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "846c8f86-7d67-4138-99c2-4f706af04d48",
                                "sense_id": "8470c20b-1a7e-36ed-beac-6962f4fa9965",
                                "text": "But now we are delivered from the law, that being dead wherein we were held; that we should serve in newness of spirit, and not in the oldness of the letter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77a9686a-5e7c-4398-9253-5126b86b2719",
                                "sense_id": "8470c20b-1a7e-36ed-beac-6962f4fa9965",
                                "text": "1795, Testimony at the trial of Sarah Sims for grand larceny at the Old Bailey, London, 20 May, 1795,\nI know it to be the property that the child wore at the time that I missed her, by the oldness of it, and the mending of it. I have not the least doubt about it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3269b7ed-a853-48ab-add4-4bc778322a34",
                                "sense_id": "8470c20b-1a7e-36ed-beac-6962f4fa9965",
                                "text": "[…] once away from the familiar implications of home, they were two men together. Ted was young only in his assumption of oldness, and the only realms, apparently, in which Babbitt had a larger and more grown-up knowledge than Ted’s were the details of real estate and the phrases of politics."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad2c514c-4293-4ee9-884d-3a81b75f2f46",
                        "source_entry_id": "97eed2bd-bd69-362f-904d-67cf73ed1068",
                        "source_sense_id": "8470c20b-1a7e-36ed-beac-6962f4fa9965",
                        "source_sense_description": "state of being old",
                        "target_lang_word": "vieillesse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vieillesse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5097825c-2b57-309e-b38b-38c452eb3842",
                                        "entry_id": "28882ffa-803c-3277-9dac-e939003d1531",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Âge avancé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0df9b841-554a-4bed-aa83-5cbd4868d11d",
                                                "sense_id": "5097825c-2b57-309e-b38b-38c452eb3842",
                                                "text": "II y a six degrés d’âges ; savoir : l’enfance proprement dite, infantia ; la seconde enfance, pueritia; l’adolescence, la virilité, la vieillesse et la décrépitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1d2e9f3-2340-4f91-befa-6861f17e019c",
                                                "sense_id": "5097825c-2b57-309e-b38b-38c452eb3842",
                                                "text": "C’était elle qui assumait dans la maison les travaux de l’homme que sa vieillesse lui eût rendus difficiles. Combien de ménagères auraient, d’elles-mêmes, pris cette initiative généreuse !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b66fd77-a160-4cbd-90d0-e80f40a9f9eb",
                                                "sense_id": "5097825c-2b57-309e-b38b-38c452eb3842",
                                                "text": "Il portait un costume gris foncé, devait avoir dans les 60 ans, mais restait vif et musclé. Les rides qu'il avait au coin des yeux rayaient de vieillesse son visage dur et impénétrable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcab4ff0-36a2-35f4-9c62-04f328c6d719",
                                        "entry_id": "28882ffa-803c-3277-9dac-e939003d1531",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vétusté, ancienneté, en parlant de choses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baee1fe2-95a3-4ccc-8e0f-bee1df8febb3",
                                                "sense_id": "dcab4ff0-36a2-35f4-9c62-04f328c6d719",
                                                "text": "Cette maison, ce bâtiment tombe de vieillesse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf4f9545-57a2-4fe8-90d2-c8dcb2a407fc",
                                                "sense_id": "dcab4ff0-36a2-35f4-9c62-04f328c6d719",
                                                "text": "La vieillesse de ces chênes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9aa25ff-a002-3acb-aefe-d47f2c8e6ee5",
                                        "entry_id": "28882ffa-803c-3277-9dac-e939003d1531",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personnes âgées en général."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46cfafb4-6944-4568-b1af-06187928d6f2",
                                                "sense_id": "a9aa25ff-a002-3acb-aefe-d47f2c8e6ee5",
                                                "text": "La vieillesse est chagrine, est avare, est soupçonneuse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
